  "blockers": [
    "Android assembly gap: androidApp/SproutPaceApplication.kt and AppActivity.kt are outside this assignment and still import the removed SproutPaceRoot/productionSproutPaceRoot placeholder contract; a host assembly assignment must construct AppRootComponent on the UI thread and pass the same instance to App.",
    "Swift assembly gap: iosApp/iosApp/iosApp.swift is outside this assignment and still calls MainViewController() with no root; it must construct/receive the production AppRootComponent with bridged lifecycle and pass that same instance to MainViewController(root:).",
    "Component contract gap: ScreenModel exposes only flat ScreenItem keys plus generic flags, not the complete typed per-screen fields required by all sixteen detailed forms/timelines/settings. The adapter renders real supplied items, selection, state, busy/offline/ad and commands, while richer screen-specific values remain unavailable until component contracts expose them.",
    "Localization contract gap: TextKey is an open string wrapper and generated Compose resources do not provide a stable public lookup by arbitrary string key. RootUiAdapter maps the currently declared screen/action/preview keys and uses localized contextual fallbacks for unknown keys; complete future keys require an explicit shared key-to-resource registry at the presentation boundary.",
    "Root must run the requested Android/iOS compilation and host tests; this specialist did not run Gradle."
  ],
